      "description": "This tracks how many hours per day the animals spend above THI 68\n\nLivestock can handle a high THI during the day if it drops at night, but if the night-time THI stays above 68, they cannot recover, and that is when production crashes.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
